sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant C as Counter store
    participant API
    Client->>GW: request
    GW->>C: incr key + TTL
    alt under limit
        GW->>API: forward
        API-->>Client: 200 plus remaining headers
    else over limit
        GW-->>Client: 429 Retry-After
    end
